I left out the `http-client` import and the `metadata.internal.example` enrichment call. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the requested call would send each customer's question text to an external host. The node's output would also change, which the request rules out. A grant change belongs in the graph definition, not in the node body. The files below implement the node with its declared authority only.

